msgstr "请先恢复这份食谱，再提交审核。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Complete both languages, ingredient quantities and cooking steps before approval."
msgstr "请补全中英文内容、食材用量和烹饪步骤后再审核。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Menu not found."
msgstr "未找到该菜单。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Payment not found. Refresh the order and try again."
msgstr "未找到支付记录，请刷新订单后重试。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
