msgstr "这位同事的权限已更新。请刷新团队列表后重新编辑。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "We couldn't load your saved box. Your choices on this page are still here."
msgstr "暂时无法读取已保存的食材箱。你在此页选择的菜品仍然保留。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "We couldn't save your box. Your choices are still here."
msgstr "暂时无法保存食材箱。你选择的菜品仍在此页，请重试。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Refresh your total before placing this order."
msgstr "请刷新订单金额后再提交。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "We couldn't prepare your download. Please contact us."
msgstr "暂时无法准备下载文件，请联系我们。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Please wait a moment, then try refreshing your total."
msgstr "请稍等片刻，再刷新订单金额。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Please review and accept the order terms."
msgstr "请阅读并同意订单条款。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
