msgstr "你在另一台设备上更新了评价。请先载入已保存的评价，再进行修改。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Your sign-in has changed. Reload your saved box to continue."
msgstr "登录状态已变化，请重新载入已保存的食材箱。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Choose a box for this delivery country."
msgstr "请选择配送至当前国家的食材箱。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "This save has already been used. Reload your saved box to continue."
msgstr "此操作已完成，请重新载入已保存的食材箱。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Sign in to continue."
msgstr "请登录后继续。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Your saved box session has ended. Reload this page to continue."
msgstr "请刷新页面，重新载入已选菜品。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Choose a new box to restart weekly deliveries."
msgstr "请重新选择菜品并下单，开启每周配送。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Resume your plan before skipping a delivery."
msgstr "请先恢复每周配送，再选择跳过。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "No longer on this menu"
msgstr "本次菜单已不提供这道菜"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
