msgstr "含有你选择避开的食材"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Sold out for this delivery"
msgstr "本次配送已售罄"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Add approved recipes before publishing this menu."
msgstr "请先添加已通过审核的食谱，再发布菜单。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Choose a sale window that ends before the delivery cutoff."
msgstr "销售时段须在配送截止时间前结束，请重新设置。"

