msgstr "邮编（选填）"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Enter the recipient's full name."
msgstr "请填写收货人姓名。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Enter a valid email address."
msgstr "请填写有效的邮箱地址。"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "Enter the street address, including the building or apartment."
msgstr "请填写街道、楼栋及门牌号等详细地址。"

