msgstr "你愿意再做这道菜吗？"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "Yes. Manage your plan in My deliveries. To change or cancel a confirmed box, open that order before its deadline. After that, contact us for help."
msgstr "可以。在“配送安排”中管理订阅；如需修改或取消已确认的食材箱，请在订单显示的截止时间前操作。超过截止时间，可联系客服。"

msgid "You have a saved box"
msgstr "账户中已有食材箱"

