msgstr "食材箱已满，请先移除一道菜。"

msgid "Your box is full. Remove a meal or choose a larger box."
msgstr "食材箱已满，请移除一道菜或选择更大的食材箱。"

msgid "Your box size changed. Remove a meal or choose a larger box to keep all your selections."
msgstr "餐盒规格已更改。请移除多余菜品，或选大一号餐盒以保留全部菜品。"

msgid "Your choices are saved for next week. Review and confirm each future box in My deliveries before ordering."
msgstr "已为下周保存你的选择。之后每份餐盒都需在“我的配送”中确认后下单。"

msgid "YOUR DELIVERY"
msgstr "你的配送"

msgid "Your download is being prepared. Please try again shortly."
msgstr "文件正在准备中，请稍后重试。"

msgid "Your food preferences"
msgstr "饮食偏好"

msgid "YOUR GATHER"
msgstr "我的 GATHER"

msgid "Your meals are no longer reserved. We're checking the payment result before you can try again."
msgstr "所选餐食已不再保留。我们正在核实支付结果，请暂勿重新付款。"

msgid "Your meals are still selected. Review your box to choose which ones to keep."
msgstr "已选菜品都还在。请查看餐盒，选择要保留的菜品。"

msgid "Your meals, your delivery, all in one place."
msgstr "菜品和配送信息，一起确认。"

msgid "Your next box needs confirmation. Review the meals and total before ordering."
msgstr "下一份食材箱等待确认。请先核对菜品和金额，再提交订单。"

msgid "Your order is confirmed."
msgstr "订单已确认"

msgid "Your past orders are in Order history. Build a box when you are ready for another delivery."
msgstr "之前的订单可在“历史订单”中查看。想再来一份时，随时挑选菜品。"

msgid "Your payment arrived after your meals were released. This box is not confirmed. Our team needs to review your payment; please don't pay again."
msgstr "款项在餐食保留时间结束后到账，订单尚未确认。我们将核实这笔付款，请勿重复付款。"

msgid "Your payment didn't go through. Your meals are saved so you can try again."
msgstr "支付未成功，所选菜品已保留，请重试。"

msgid "Your plan is"
msgstr "当前配送计划"

msgid "Your previous delivery date is no longer available. Choose a new date to continue."
msgstr "之前选择的日期已无法配送，请重新选择。"

msgid "Your requests"
msgstr "申请记录"

msgid "Your saved box is empty."
msgstr "已保存的食材箱中没有菜品。"

msgid "Your staff access is available in the countries below."
msgstr "你可以管理以下国家的业务。"

msgid "Your table. Your kind of good."
msgstr "你的餐桌，你的好滋味。"

msgid "Your team starts here"
msgstr "开始组建团队"

msgid "Your total will appear when it is ready."
msgstr "正在确认订单金额。"

msgid "Your week, your way"
msgstr "按你的节奏订餐"
